   Bynder:DescriptionMP="Driver fueling up at heavy duty hydrogen station. &#xA;&#xA;Shell is part of several initiatives to encourage the adoption and growth of hydrogen in a range of sectors, from production to transport. This shoot features Shellâ€™s first heavy duty refuelling station in Wilmington California. The station was built as part of the Shore to Shore project from the Â California Climate Investments, a statewide initiative that puts billions of Cap-and-Trade dollars to work reducing greenhouse gas emissions, strengthening the economy, and improving public health and the environment â€” particularly in disadvantaged communities.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Shell Hydrogen, Hydrogen, HD, Heavy Duty, Trucker, Transport,  Over the road transport, decarbonization, net zero, renewables and energy solutions, Toyota, Kenworth"
